# Toolchain pins besides .tool-versions' Erlang, Elixir and Bun. CI
# loads them into each job's environment, and scripts/setup-toolchain.ts
# installs Hex and rebar3 from them locally too. Like Hex and pnpm
# dependencies, each is held to the newest stable release at least 24h
# old, or a younger one that fixes a published advisory:
# scripts/toolchain.ts checks them in the pre-push gate and moves them in
# the pre-commit bump.
